            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna lameeso ka hayyu Darioni lafa fide, guyya diddami toko, ka jia torbeeso, AABBO Waaqi ammalle raaga Hagai jed'aniini dubbate waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan atini Zerubabeli, ilma Shealtieli, ka lafa fidufi Yoshua, ilma Yehosadaki, ka qaallu guddatifi ammalle gumi taani ch'ufaani jettu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Isani keesa nami Mana kiyya kana aka inni duri mid'aagu arge jira? Amma yo laaltani akami jira? Woma tokole isaniti fakaata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi Guddaani waan jed'u, Amma Zerubabeli, garaa jabaad'i; Yoshua, ilma Yehosadaki, ka qaallu gudda, atileeni garaa jabaad'i. Gumi lafa tana, isanileeni garaa jabaad'a hojad'a, anini isani woliini jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.45+EXO.29.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 29.45-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gaafa isani lafa Misiri keesaa baatani, Haga jiru jireenna isani woliini taa jed'e, ammalle isanuma woliini jira, insodaatina jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
